@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Things to Do";
}

<div class="row">
    <div class="col">
        <p><strong>There's a number of options for the Boston area over the weekend!</strong></p>

        <p>
            @Html.Hyperlink("The Red Sox have a home game series", "https://www.mlb.com/redsox/tickets/single-game-tickets").
            We'd advise against the August 22nd game.
        </p>
        <p>
            If the weather is nice, take a walk around the Boston Common, 
            ride a @Html.Hyperlink("swan boat", "https://swanboats.com/")
            or @Html.Hyperlink("the carousel", "https://bostonfrogpond.com/frog-pond-carousel/"),
            or splash in Frog Pond.
            You can also check out the Esplanade or the Arnold Arboretum (where we had our first date!).
        </p>
        <p>
            For indoor activities, our favorite museums in the area are the 
            @Html.Hyperlink("Museum of Science", "https://www.mos.org/") or the
            @Html.Hyperlink("Museum of Fine Arts", "https://www.mfa.org/").
        </p>
        <p>
            Our favorite restaurants in the area include 
            @Html.Hyperlink("Antico Forno", "https://www.anticofornoboston.com/"),
            @Html.Hyperlink("Pho Pasteur", "https://phopasteurboston.net/"),
            @Html.Hyperlink("Hot Pot Buffet", "https://hot-pot-buffet.placejoys.com/"),
            and @Html.Hyperlink("Dumpling Palace", "https://www.dumpling-palace.com/").
            For drinks, Boston has several brewery experience options including the 
            @Html.Hyperlink("Sam Adams Brewery", "https://www.samadamsbostonbrewery.com/") or the
            @Html.Hyperlink("Downeast Cider House", "https://downeastcider.com/").
        </p>
    </div>

</div>